24.8 Wait Set

Another common interview topic.

Suppose Thread-A executes

lock.wait();

What happens?

Releases the monitor.
Moves to the Wait Set.

Monitor
↓
Wait Set
↓
Thread-A

Notice

It is not in the Entry Set anymore.

